      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BARRAMUNDI LOU (1) turned in a plain performance last time when eighth at this track over 400m behind Creeping Tiger (23.86) in a Grade 3/4. Was in the money prior to that. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. AUSSIE OSCAR (3) goes very well at the course and distance with seven wins and a placing from 15 starts. In the money last time at this track (23.20) in a NG, finishing a 5.5 lengths second. Makes strong appeal on best. DASHING MIMCO (2) showed good early burn but run over late to finish 6th at this track in NG company. Solid record here at the distance winning 11 races. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. LAURIE'S RUPEE (6) has strong claims after a top-three finish last time out.",
